hat have formed near melting glaciers.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17=
px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>In August 2024, who=
le swaths of Thame were destroyed after rockfall landed in a remote lake ab=
ove the village, where water from melting glaciers had been pooling. The ro=
cks displaced an enormous amount of water, which then was sent cascading do=
wn the mountain, picking up speed and also sand, silt, gravel and boulders.=
</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margi=
